      "chunk_id": "f3bdccac-a301-4df5-939d-005cf43d5e52",
      "content": "Data Retention\n\nCustomer contracts must be retained for seven years after expiration. Vendor agreements must be retained for six years after termination. Employee agreements must be retained according to HR retention rules and any legal hold instructions.\n\nDraft contracts that never reach signature may be deleted after 18 months unless they are part of an active dispute, audit, or legal hold. Executed agreements must never be deleted from the contract repository.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002008",
      "document_id": "LEGAL-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "56f368ca-8cf8-4eec-b828-67bb1302a583",
      "content": "Contract Approval Process\n\n| Contract Type | Legal Review | Finance Review | Final Approver |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Standard customer order form under USD 25,000 ARR | Optional unless redlines exist | Deal Desk | Sales Manager |\n| Customer contract with security addendum | Required | Deal Desk | Sales Director |\n| Vendor agreement under USD 10,000 | Required if data processing applies | Finance | Department Manager |\n| Vendor agreement USD 10,000 or above | Required | Finance | Department Leader |\n| Employment-related agreement | Required | HR Admin | People Leader |\n\nNo employee may sign a contract on behalf of Northstar unless they are listed in the signature authority register maintained by Legal Operations.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002008",
      "document_id": "LEGAL-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "5988b6eb-ead1-4dd6-afc0-1754753afcad",
      "content": "Handoff Rules\n\nSales must hand off qualified technical requirements to Solutions Engineering before technical validation. Customer-specific contract commitments must not be promised without approval from Legal and Deal Desk.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002005",
      "document_id": "SALES-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7e7c811c-b257-4d95-8df0-3ce9978c5746",
      "content": "Escalation Triggers\n\nEscalate to Legal before signature when a contract includes uncapped liability, customer audit rights broader than annual review, unusual data residency commitments, indemnity expansion, auto-renewal longer than one year, or commitments to future roadmap functionality.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002008",
      "document_id": "LEGAL-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "401ca1bc-ceee-40a1-b151-532bcae431d6",
      "content": "Current Version\n\nVersion 1.2 is effective March 1, 2026. It supersedes the November 2025 contract intake checklist. If a deal note, sales deck, or vendor email conflicts with this policy, Legal Operations must resolve the conflict before signature.",
